  "_comment": "P71 legacy-ID translation table. Maps pre-flattening 1.12.2 (name, meta) block/item ids and numeric ids to their 1.20.4 registry names. Offline, deterministic, testable (open question 4: offline JSON chosen over runtime DFU access). Meta is resolved per-block via explicit pick-lists / families, never a single global formula (S05 P71 quirk). Reference knowledge only from BBS LegacyIds; no BBS class copied.",

  "colors": [
    "white", "orange", "magenta", "light_blue", "yellow", "lime", "pink", "gray",
