  },

  "_comment_dyeDamage": "Color families whose 1.12 metadata is a dye-damage value, NOT byMetadata: EnumDyeColor.byDyeDamage inverts the colour order (white=15 ... black=0). Banner is the sole such family (ItemBanner.getBaseColor = byDyeDamage(meta & 15)); wool/bed/etc. use byMetadata and stay in colorFamilies. Resolved via colors[15 - (meta & 15)] so damage 0 -> black_banner (1.12 parity, CROSS_CUTTING 1.1).",
  "dyeDamageFamilies": {
    "banner": "_banner"
  },

